-## Root cause (not the same as the 2026-08-19 root cause)
-
-The 2026-08-19 incident was **write attempted, exception silently
-swallowed to logger.debug**. The b838a6d fail-loud fix (2026-08-20
-10:58 UTC) elevated that to `logger.error(exc_info=True)` and also
-added the read-side `[D1-STALE-ANCHOR]` warning. Both are correct
-fixes for that failure class.
